      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S FULL ON (2) has been in the money at the last couple here when racing on speed, last outing finishing second beaten 5.5 lengths (23.87). Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Winning claims. AFFILIATED (3) finished eighth last time at Q Straight but could not have been more impressive a few runs back in his sharp 23.79 win at this track over 407m. Rates a leading chance if runs up to recent winning time. REGARDING HENRY (6) turned spotting a big start finishing sixth (24.16) last time in a Grade 4 at this track. Got the money at his only try from this box. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. TUSKEN TIGER (7) is a surprise last-start placegetter who should be thereabouts.",
